<title>DENMARK: Exportfinans issues 500 mln DKK 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Exportfinans issues 500 mln DKK 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced on Tuesday by Den Danske Bank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - EXPORTFINANS ASA   AMOUNT 500 MLN DKK</p>
<p>MATURITY - 8 NOVEMBER 2001  COUPON - FOUR PERCENT  </p>
<p>PAY DATE - 8 NOVEMBER 1996    ISS PRICE - TO BE ADVISED LAST S&amp;P</p>
<p>- AAA   LAST MOODY'S - Aa1 --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom</p>
<p>+45 33 969650</p>
</text>
